OL,3,GNEWSAWoman sends life-saving message
OL,4,Aafter sea rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who helped rescue two boys who
OL,7,Fhad got into difficulty in the sea has
OL,8,Fstressed the importance of floating on
OL,9,Fyour back if in trouble in water.
OL,11,FCaroline Robb, 60, from Totternhoe,
OL,12,FBedfordshire, helped save the lives of
OL,13,Fthe two brothers off the coast of
OL,14,FHunstanton, Norfolk, on 14 August.
OL,16,FThe former Metropolitan police officer
OL,17,Fsaid when she got into the water she
OL,18,Fkept shouting at them to lie on their
OL,19,Fbacks and not to panic.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
